### Python ML Specialist Fusion Engine

#### [NEW] [fusion_analyzer.py](file:///c:/Users/krish/Desktop/SatVistaar/backend/services/ml_inference/fusion_analyzer.py)
- Dedicated Python ML fusion service:
  - **SAR Preprocessing**: intensity log-transformation ($10 \cdot \log_{10}(I)$ for dB representation), speckle noise reduction via adaptive median/Lee filtering, texture variance estimation.
  - **Optical Preprocessing**: band normalization, RGB synthesis, vegetation index (NDVI proxy) and water index (NDWI proxy) extraction.
  - **Cross-Modal Fusion Core**:
    - High SAR backscatter + High optical edge density $\rightarrow$ High-confidence Built-up / Infrastructure.
    - Low SAR backscatter (specular reflection) + Low optical reflectance / high NDWI $\rightarrow$ High-confidence Water body.
    - Moderate diffuse SAR backscatter + High optical greenness $\rightarrow$ Agriculture / Dense Vegetation.
    - Low optical visibility (clouds/shadows) + Clear SAR structure $\rightarrow$ SAR-dominant penetrating observation.
    - Mismatch (e.g. smooth concrete dark in SAR vs bright in optical) $\rightarrow$ Modality Disagreement / Uncertainty.
  - **Visual Fusion Output**: Generates an evidence-based fusion raster / overlay layer.
  - Supports Modes A through G (Joint Semantic, Built-up, Water, Flood, Agriculture, Infrastructure, NL Query).

